{"parse": {"title": "THH-14", "pageid": 64950, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/THH-13\" title=\"THH-13\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">THH-14</span><a href=\"/wiki/THH-15\" title=\"THH-15\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">THH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">14</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.BF.9D.E4.BD.91.E5.A5.B9\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"保佑她\">保佑她</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 保佑她</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">May They Be Blessed</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>女<span class=\"color-value\"></span>孩<span class=\"color-value\"></span>或<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>羔<span class=\"color-value\"></span>羊<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>她<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>都<span class=\"color-value\"></span>应<span class=\"color-value\"></span>当<span class=\"color-value\"></span>获<span class=\"color-value\"></span>得<span class=\"color-value\"></span>拯<span class=\"color-value\"></span>救<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2110114</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>电话彼端的声音还在继续。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-309910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-309910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-309910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>太好了，既然电话能够被使用，我想风的步伐也许还在附近游荡……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……别担心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>你是《UTTU》的编辑？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>电话彼端的人松了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>……是的，小姐，正如您所说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>不过，在对话开始前，您能告诉我现在是哪一年吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……1990年。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>噢……我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>细弱的声音镇定了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……数羊羔小姐，我要怎样才能见到您？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-309913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-309913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-309913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>见到我……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>是的，我是隶属于圣洛夫基金会的司辰——基金会希望能够得知兀尔德的下落，故而派我来寻找您。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>但目前，您的安全状况似乎不容乐观。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-309914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-309914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-309914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>维尔汀小姐，这个房间隔绝了所有的联络，我听不到风的声音，无法得知兀尔德的下落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……风的声音？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>是的，您可以理解为一种特殊的联络方式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我要怎样才能帮助您？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>嗯……我先为您讲述一下当前的情况。现在，我能够确定的有以下几件事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>首先，这个旅馆并不是普通的旅馆，而是某种特殊的、具备超自然者般的生命力的存在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>在入住旅馆前，我对附近的居民做过访谈，他们无一不提到了近几个月以来，在附近出现的都市怪谈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>确实，我们在旅馆中也遇到了类似的情况——这是一个怪谈泛滥的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>第二，我现在被困在一个红色的房间里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>这个房间与你们同样地处于旅馆之中……但与你们的房间不同，它隔绝了一切信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>我没有办法打开那扇门，也没有办法呼出电话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>不过，一声枪响打破了这份无形的桎梏……在枪响之后，这个小房间猛烈地进行了一次收缩。随后，一切线路畅通无阻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>我最初还以为是某种地震，但随后，被压缩的空间又恢复了原状——我想这应该不能用“地震”来解释。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>在这之前，您依靠蜘蛛来传递信息吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>嗯，所幸这里有很多蜘蛛……我想，这应该与蜘蛛在都市怪谈中的泛滥有关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>电话彼端传来了翻书页的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>譬如说有许多人会忧虑“在头发中生存的蜘蛛”……实际上这是一个来源于13世纪英国的说教故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>“一位爱慕虚荣的信众总是在做弥撒的时候迟到，因为她花了太多时间来整理她的头发，结果魔鬼以蜘蛛的形式附着在了她的头发中。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>……是的，这些小家伙以它们的方式替我传递信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>我很担忧自己处于一个与外界隔绝的空间中，这会令我联想到某些不好的事……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她轻轻地喘了几口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>所幸并不如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>您并没有办法离开那个房间对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>是的，它没有门，我无法离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>那么，您当初是如何进去的呢……或者说，是谁带你进入这个房间的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>噢，还能有谁呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>是那个名叫蓝……蓝手帕的侍应生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>果然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-309714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……等等。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>久未出声的雇佣兵打断了对话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-309910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-309910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-309910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>您是阿尔古斯，对吗？我还记得您的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……对，是我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>那之后我又折返去了你所停驻的地方，但你那时已经不见了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>——你在那时就到达了这家旅店吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>嗯，蓝手帕看见了我，她邀请我前往这个旅馆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>噢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>您想问些什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>您在这里，看见一个高约5英尺3英寸的女孩了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>她穿着白裙子，一头栗色的卷发，眼珠子则是翠绿色的，手很小。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ed/HeadIconSmall-309912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ed/HeadIconSmall-309912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ed/HeadIconSmall-309912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>也许我见过她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>在我刚刚到达的时候，有这样的一个女孩从楼道上走了下来——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>她挎着一个空空的篮子，我想她也许是去附近的镇子上购物了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>我记得她并没有退房。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……谢谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她脱力地耷拉着肩膀，眼中的辉光虚弱地熄灭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她不再说话了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们该怎么找到那个房间呢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>它很好找，就在走廊的一侧，编号为707。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>那是一扇红色的门……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguandanrenjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>滴滴滴——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……电话断了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>阿尔古斯，我知道了，数羊羔就在那个名为707的房间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>那么，接下来，你要去镇子上找你的凯拉吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>短暂的沉默之后，她再次开口了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>我曾在走廊上见过一个奇怪的地方……侍应生的脚印围绕着它——那应该是一个被频繁出入的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>但我却没有看到任何的门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雇佣兵用已上膛的枪管戳了戳头上的痒处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>如果有一天你死在了你自己的枪口之下，我也并不会意外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>哈，那可真是帮了我大忙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……开玩笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雇佣兵振作了精神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>那个侍应生并不想让我们知道数羊羔在这座旅馆之中——哈，可惜，百密一疏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>情况已经非常明晰——走吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>等一下，老板。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她咬着嘴唇，露出了一副为难的样子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>你那儿还有多余的糖果吗？我的糖已经快要吃完了，这儿没有什么补给的手段。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>发出请求对她而言似乎是一件很困难的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她从口袋里掏出了几枚糖果，塞在了阿尔古斯的掌心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>很快我们就能从这里出去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我找到数羊羔，你也能找到凯拉。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "THH-14"}}